  - subtour linear program
  - integrality gap
abstract: >-
  Machine-checked Lean 4 formalizations over Mathlib of the improved sunflower
  bounds and an upper bound on the metric TSP subtour-LP integrality gap.
  The sunflower development includes Alweiss–Lovett–Wu–Zhang, Rao–Bell–Chueluecha–Warnke,
  robust-sunflower lower bounds and Erdos–Rado. The TSP development follows
  Karlin–Klein–Oveis Gharan, Gurvits–Klein–Leake and Song, and proves the
  existence of a tour of cost at most (3/2 - 2.05522e-30) times any feasible
  subtour-LP objective. The shared build includes axiom checks and regression
  examples. Documentation records the scope and adaptations of the proofs.
